	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Move it! We'll be surrounded at this rate!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"I rally my comrades behind me as I take point in our formation.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Our ragtag rebellion comprises forty-odd captured warriors and priestesses.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Though we managed to steal the handful of spellblades in the garrison's armory, our fighting strength still leaves much to be desired.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"We don't have a second to waste in breaking out of the Republican occupation zone and fleeing Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"I first returned to my senses a few evenings ago.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"A pair of Republican soldiers were escorting me across the occupation.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"I don't remember how I got there.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"As though waking from a dream, I suddenly found myself standing where I was.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Once my sudden confusion subsided, I eventually realized that I must have been afflicted by the magicks of that priestess Yagi Sekka.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"In all likelihood, I was turned into a mindless puppet just like Father.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I don't know why the spell was broken, but it's possible that Sekka was incapacitated or killed.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Fortunately, the Republican soldiers accompanying me were completely unaware that I'd regained my senses.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"This was my Oomikami-given chance.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"I continued pretending to be a mindless puppet while waiting for my chance to escape.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"And that chance came to me earlier today.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Anyone who can't move on their own, pair up with an uninjured warrior! We're all getting out of this alive!”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"As soon as I escaped, I freed all the other warriors and priestesses I could find.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"We stole back our captured spellblades and seized control of the garrison.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Along the way, we made sure to smash up all the suspicious Artifacts that were being developed there.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"The problem comes from our next step.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"No matter what, we need to escape from the Republican occupation.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Up until now, we've snuck along alleyways to avoid detection, but at some point, we'll need to make a break for it across the main street.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We're going in! Watch your backs!”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Steeling myself, I leap out from behind our cover.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I knew it. An ambush!”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"But a screen of lead is hardly enough to stop a warrior with spellblade in hand.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"We spring forward at once and neutralize the enemy soldiers firing on us.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Tanks?!”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"At the end of the road, the enemy has deployed a column of tanks to serve as a barricade.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Another enemy unit is also rapidly closing in behind us.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"We have nowhere left to run.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"If we just sit here and do nothing, we'll be wiped out to the last.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"The only way out is through.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll clear a path! The rest of you, protect the priestesses and break through my opening!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"This is our only chance.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"I whisper to my spellblade, hardening my resolve once more before the end.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Please, lend me your power.)”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Leaving my comrades to fend for themselves, I rush into the fray for the last time.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Just then─",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"A tank explodes in the distance with a deafening blast.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What... in the world...?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"The Republican soldiers lined up in front of their makeshift barricade break their formation and scatter.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"There's no way.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"I didn't even dare to dream it, but still, you really came for me...",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"It really is you─",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Soujin!",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Across the battlefield, Hotori's hope-filled eyes meet my own.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Thank Oomikami, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"she's alive.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, we're charging in!”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Understood!”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Carving my way through the barricade of enemy tanks, I make my way towards Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Thanks to my work at the flower shop, I have the layout of the Republican occupation fully memorized.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"And my guess of where Hotori's group would find themselves pinned down was right on the money.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Akari and I cut down another group of Republican soldiers and send another tank to the scrap heap.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Taking advantage of the blinding explosion and billowing cloud of smoke, I rush to Hotori's side.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"I toss her a cache of a dozen spellblades that were stored for safekeeping at Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Glad to see that you're safe.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Neither of us'd go down that easily.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"For a brief moment, we exchange a smile between warriors.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're bringing in more and more reinforcements. We\nwon't be able to take them on with our numbers.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Leave it to me. I'll break through and clear an escape path.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Hotori passes each of the remaining unarmed warriors a spellblade, securing the keenblade among them to her own hip.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, it's not time yet.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Not time yet? Now's our best chance.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san will be here soon with reinforcements of our own. We just need to hold out until then.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now that's what I like to hear.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"I scan our surroundings and find Republican soldiers surrounding us on all sides.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So then, what's our plan of attack?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You, Soujin, and I will break their ranks.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Everyone else can protect the priestesses and buy time for Mutsumi-san to arrive with the cavalry. How's that sound?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sounds good. Let's have some fun.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"We have a plan.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You heard all that, didn't you?! Protect these priestesses with your lives!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"A chorus of war cries resounds in response.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, don't push yourself too hard.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"At Hotori's signal, the three of us leap into the enemy lines in separate directions.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"The moment we dive out behind our cover, we're met with a veritable hail of bullets, but─",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Republican Soldier"},
			{
"“Fuck, I can't draw a bead!”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Faster than a raging gale, I close the distance and cut the line of Republican soldiers into ribbons.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Once you've managed to break into their formation, the day is yours.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Like a man possessed, I indiscriminately cut down anyone that crosses my path.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Dodge, then swing, and then onto the next enemy before the last even hits the ground.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's your lucky day. I've got plenty of resentment to let out on you, Republican scum!”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Hotori rampages across the battlefield in an expression of her pent-up frustration.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Her lightning-fast bladework is every bit as sharp as ever.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you don't want to die, throw down your weapons and run away!”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Akari is also not holding anything back as she cuts down one Republican soldier after another.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mh...!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"But unfortunately, we're still hopelessly outnumbered.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"The three of us are barely causing enough chaos to prevent our allies from being overrun.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Until suddenly, several explosions erupt in the back lines of the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"I look up to find a formation of warriors making short work of the enemy's rear lines, clearing a path for us.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're here!”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Do pardon our tardiness.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama! Reinforcements have arrived!”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san and Kotone are trailed by over a dozen priestesses.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Is Hotori-sama in good health?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, she's going wild over there.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Noticing Mutsumi-san's arrival, Hotori only proceeds to cut into the enemy with an even greater ferocity.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hehee, in that case, perhaps I shall go indulge myself alongside her.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Her spellblade in hand, Mutsumi-san wastes no time charging into the heart of the enemy formation.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, where might the escaped priestesses be?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're being protected by the warriors. Over here!”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"I escort Kotone and her retinue of priestesses to the escapees.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"As soon as Kotone arrives, the escaped priestesses' eyes light up.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I humbly apologize for having caused you concern. I would be more than glad to catch up at a later time.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“For now, let us prioritize extricating ourselves from our current predicament.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"All the priestesses nod in response.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I ask your assistance in pooling our strength to safeguard the warriors with a Spellshield.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I shall serve as the conduit, so please direct all of your magicks to me.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"The priestesses nod again in unison.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, in order to cover everyone with the Spellshield, I will need to be at the center of the battlefield.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Would you protect me?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't mind, but are you sure you should be using magicks?”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"At my expression of concern, Kotone faces me with a gentle smile.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I will simply be channeling everyone else's power, so the burden will not be anything I cannot handle.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The two of us shall live on together, for as long as we can... Is that not so?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"As long as she agrees with that, I can rest easy.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right. I'll guard your life with my own!”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I have never felt safer!”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Kotone and I nod to each other.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Okay, let's move!”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes!”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"I pick Kotone up in my arms, gather my strength, and with a single leap─",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"I land in the heart of the battlefield, setting Kotone down as bullets whiz over our heads.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“All right, here I go!”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"The magicks channeled to her by the other priestesses cause her body to glow with an ethereal light.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Terrible mighty Oomikami, Thy humble servant beseeches Thee. Bestow of me Thy powers Lordly...”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"As she murmurs her invocation, the fervor of the battle reaches a fever pitch.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not on my watch!”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"I cut down all the bullets flying in our direction.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“May Thy divine protection deliver the warriors from all harm!”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"With Kotone's shout, a dramatic change occurs in the bodies of all the warriors fighting on the front lines.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"The bullets flying towards them deflected harmlessly, each warrior is transfigured into a being incapable of being harmed even by the powerful firearms of the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Warriors of the Empire, you are under the protection of Her Majesty's priestesses!”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"At Kotone's declaration, the empowered warriors surge forward in a berserk frenzy.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Advancing fearlessly forward, they leap into the enemy lines as a crashing wave.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"Kotone's spell does not go unnoticed, and enemy marksmen immediately train their fire upon her.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"However─",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone!”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"I knock all of their bullets out of the air.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"If they want to get to Kotone, they'll have to get through me first.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oomikami shall bring us victory.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Kotone proudly pronounces, directing her open palms towards the Republican soldiers.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“For as long as the Empire endures, there will always remain an unconditional fount of love for its inhabitants.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even down to the last, we priestesses shall bestow our love upon this Empire and our benedictions upon its people!”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And you will never, ever break our spirit!”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Kotone screams aloud her unshakable determination.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Her heart, overflowing with its boundless love, strengthens her Spellshield into a barrier impregnable to all mortal steel.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"The Republican Army has absolutely no hope of standing against these warriors under Oomikami's protection.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"One by one, the enemy soldiers lose their nerve and retreat, until the entire Republican Army is put to rout.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"At last, the day is ours.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I believe there's an Imperial proverb along the lines of 'a rat will lash out at the cat that corners it.'”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“So, what of Sekka?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“She was a party in the search for the ringleaders of the coup d'etat.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“But considering that our expeditionary force was annihilated, it is likely that she, too, has perished.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Why did you dispatch Sekka to the front lines?”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“She was an important pawn in my plans. You ought to have known that.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Rochel's face betrays no consternation.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Inner Iseya was concealed by most ingenious camouflage magicks. None other than Sekka would have been capable of unmasking it in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“That's enough. What's done is done. No amount of complaining will change that.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Warren dismissively waves his hand.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“That said, my plans are now at an impasse.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“If my forces were still in any fighting condition, I'd at least be able to leave things to a successor, but the warriors have destroyed them all.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I have no more use for the Empire. We're pulling out.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I'll leave what's left of the Empire to Elsa.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Rochel, what will you do?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I will naturally accompany you, Your Excellency.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Rochel respectfully lowers his head.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Suit yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Leaving it at that, Warren saunters out of the\ngovernor-general's office without another word.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Oh dearie me...”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Left by his lonesome, Rochel plops himself down into the\ngovernor-general's luxurious chair.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I sure got awfully far, but I suppose that's all from me this time.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“If only the Exalt-Priestess had managed to destroy that orb...”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Letting out a deep sigh, Rochel chuckles annoyedly to himself.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Well, so be it.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I suppose I can afford to spend the next century or two looking for my next canvas.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“After all, I have all the time in the world...”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Rising leisurely to his feet, the young Republican soldier strolls out of the room.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"True to his word, he has absolutely no need to rush.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"For so long as the Empire continues to endure, time will always be on his side─",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon, Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Elsa throws open the door to Kanami's chambers, a solitary room located deep in the Republican Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“It seems that there is quite the commotion outside.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"The far-off sounds of gunshots and explosions have not failed to escape Kanami's attentive ears.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The convicts under arrest in the Republican occupation have initiated an armed insurrection.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Have you managed to subdue them?”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, they appear to have gotten away.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Ehehee, that's the first good news I've received in a long time.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Elsa can't help but smile wryly at Kanami's defiant declaration of a prison break as being “good news.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Well then, what are your intentions moving forward, Madam Vice Governor-General?”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hmm, I think I'll start by lifting all restrictions on Your\nMajesty's freedom of movement.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Effective immediately, Your Majesty is free to step outside, attend school, and conduct yourself however you so wish.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“...How so?”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Kanami is naturally skeptical of Elsa's words.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The current governor-general will be taking leave of the Empire in short order.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Administration of this country will be passed on to yours truly, the vice governor-general.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I suppose congratulations are in order. You're finally free to carry out your ambitions without reservations.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Indeed. I plan to move forward immediately with the democratization of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“So how does securing my release play into your designs?”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I assure you, you'll receive no cooperation from me even in exchange for my freedom.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How about if I sweeten the deal with a special pardon for Tokita-kun and all the other warriors who were complicit in Operation Bellflower?”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Do you mean to suggest that Onii-sama is alive?!”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Kanami leans forward, fixing Elsa with searching eyes.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Seeing the extent to which Empress Hisui swallowed her bait, Elsa reassures herself that confining her was indeed the right decision.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"After all, there's simply no telling the lengths Kanami would have gone to for her Onii-sama.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"For the sake of her own safety, Elsa needed her to behave herself until she secured complete authority over the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"─Protect Kanami until Tokita-kun returns to Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"That was the promise Elsa made with Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"To that end, even imprisoning Empress Hisui was a recourse she was willing to resort to, all in order to protect Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Feeling ready to change your tune and hear me out?”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Why, I would love to!”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"─I would give anything, even my life, for Onii-sama's sake.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"That is the animating principle that guides every last one of Kanami's actions.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"And so, for the first time in a long time, the two compatriots sit down as equals.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"Their passionate conversation continues long into the chill autumn night─",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"Until the bright dawn breaks upon a new Empire.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
